# Command: API Documentation (Swagger)

## Purpose
Generates and serves the OpenAPI/Swagger specification UI for interactive API contract testing.

## Access & Location
The Swagger documentation module is compiled dynamically at application runtime in development mode.
- **Default Endpoint**: Upon backend startup, access via web browser at `http://localhost:3000/api/docs`.

## Code Generation Standard

- Swagger setup: `api/src/config/swagger.config.ts` (invoked from `main.ts`).
- When creating endpoints, use `@nestjs/swagger` decorators (`@ApiTags`, `@ApiOperation`, `@ApiResponse`, `@ApiBearerAuth`) on controllers and `@ApiProperty` on DTOs.